@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:User a owl:Class.
hpc:System a owl:Class.
hpc:Database a owl:Class.
hpc:grantpermission a owl:ObjectProperty.
hpc:innodbsupport a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Engine a owl:Class.
hpc:Slurmdbd a owl:Class.

hpc:User rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Resource.
hpc:System rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Resource.
hpc:Database rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Resource.
hpc:GrantPermission rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty.
